    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests {@link IOCase}. <p> Most tests come in two flavors: </p> <ul> <li>{@code *_case} tests verify how each {@link IOCase} constant treats letter case. {@link IOCase#SENSITIVE} distinguishes case, {@link IOCase#INSENSITIVE} ignores it, and {@link IOCase#SYSTEM} follows the host OS (case-insensitive on Windows, case-sensitive elsewhere).</li> <li>{@code *_functionality} tests verify the underlying matching logic (prefixes, suffixes, indices, null handling) using only {@link IOCase#SENSITIVE}.</li> </ul>"
   },
